<!--
    Black Box: icons on a 24x24 grid in the geometric angular language of NieR:Automata's YoRHa OS:
    45-deg diamond nodes, rectilinear frames, musical double-bars, and mechanical pointers.
    IconMainMenu is the theme's original Black Box octagram enclosing a concentric diamond core.
    Playnite menu icons keep Playnite's icofont glyphs, recolored onto theme brushes.
-->
